                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       REFRESH-NCD-YEARS-0073.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
